              "details": {
                "badge": "Planning Tips",
                "date": "14 Jul, 2025",
                "author": "By Admin",
                "heading": {
                  "main": "Your Guide to",
                  "highlight": "Stress-Free Booking"
                },
                "featuredImage": {
                  "src": "/images/about_02.png",
                  "alt": "Luxury Sunset Wedding Coastal Arch with Candles and Flowers"
                },
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Planning a beautiful event doesn't have to be stressful. Whether you're organizing a wedding, a corporate event, or a private celebration, choosing the right venue and managing the details early can make the entire experience smooth and enjoyable. With the right approach, you can create a memorable event that reflects your style and leaves a lasting impression on your guests.",
                  "Today's digital tools make the booking process easier than ever. You can compare venues, explore photos, read real reviews, and check availability with just a few clicks. A little research and early planning can help you secure the best dates, deals, and services for your special occasion.",
                  "When booking, consider factors like location, cancellation policies, and included services such as catering, décor, lighting, and parking. Many venues offer customizable packages, allowing you to choose what fits your needs and budget. Booking early, especially during peak seasons, can also give you access to exclusive discounts and preferred dates.",
                  "A thoughtful approach to event planning helps you avoid last-minute stress and ensures comfort throughout your celebration. With smart planning and a bit of research, you can turn any event into a truly memorable experience — whether it's an intimate gathering or a grand celebration."
                ],
                "checklist": [
                  "Explore stunning venues offering breathtaking views and memorable experiences for every guest",
                  "Reserve your venue effortlessly online and enjoy seamless booking",
                  "Secure your event today and enjoy exclusive deals, exceptional services, and perfect locations"
                ],
                "quote": {
                  "text": "A well-planned event is the beginning of beautiful memories that last a lifetime.",
                  "author": "Event Planning Expert"
                },
                "closingParagraph": "Beyond personal milestones, event booking offers a unique opportunity to bring people together. From elegant weddings and lively celebrations to professional corporate events, the right venue and planning can set the tone for an unforgettable experience. By focusing on the details and choosing trusted partners, you can enjoy a seamless process and a truly remarkable event."
              }
